{"page": 49, "lines": [{"t": "DSP-2232 OPERATING MANUAL", "x": 257.0, "y": 63.0}, {"t": "4.", "x": 454.0, "y": 1141.0}, {"t": "PACKET RADIO", "x": 1632.0, "y": 69.0}, {"t": "Your DSP—2232 contains other Packet modems that may be selected", "x": 567.0, "y": 185.0}, {"t": "with the MODEM command. If you wish to select a different DSP", "x": 564.0, "y": 225.0}, {"t": "modem for Packet operation, simply type MODEM followed by a modem", "x": 564.0, "y": 266.0}, {"t": "number from", "x": 566.0, "y": 306.0}, {"t": "the list below:", "x": 808.0, "y": 306.0}, {"t": "10:", "x": 668.0, "y": 385.0}, {"t": "11:", "x": 667.0, "y": 425.0}, {"t": "12:", "x": 667.0, "y": 464.0}, {"t": "13:", "x": 666.0, "y": 504.0}, {"t": "14:", "x": 666.0, "y": 543.0}, {"t": "15:", "x": 666.0, "y": 583.0}, {"t": "16:", "x": 665.0, "y": 623.0}, {"t": "17:", "x": 664.0, "y": 663.0}, {"t": "18:", "x": 664.0, "y": 702.0}, {"t": "50:", "x": 663.0, "y": 742.0}, {"t": "51:", "x": 663.0, "y": 783.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 746.0, "y": 386.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 745.0, "y": 426.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 745.0, "y": 465.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 744.0, "y": 505.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 744.0, "y": 544.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 743.0, "y": 583.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 743.0, "y": 623.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 743.0, "y": 663.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 742.0, "y": 703.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 742.0, "y": 743.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 742.0, "y": 783.0}, {"t": "pl", "x": 742.0, "y": 823.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 807.0, "y": 385.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 807.0, "y": 425.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 806.0, "y": 465.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 806.0, "y": 504.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 806.0, "y": 543.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 806.0, "y": 583.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 805.0, "y": 622.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 804.0, "y": 663.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 804.0, "y": 702.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 804.0, "y": 743.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 803.0, "y": 784.0}, {"t": "Packet", "x": 804.0, "y": 823.0}, {"t": "300 bps HF 2110/2310", "x": 947.0, "y": 385.0}, {"t": "300 bps HF 1460/1260", "x": 947.0, "y": 424.0}, {"t": "(North America)", "x": 1394.0, "y": 385.0}, {"t": "( European )", "x": 1394.0, "y": 426.0}, {"t": "1200", "x": 948.0, "y": 465.0}, {"t": "1200", "x": 948.0, "y": 505.0}, {"t": "1200", "x": 947.0, "y": 544.0}, {"t": "2400", "x": 946.0, "y": 583.0}, {"t": "4800", "x": 945.0, "y": 623.0}, {"t": "4800", "x": 945.0, "y": 663.0}, {"t": "9600", "x": 944.0, "y": 703.0}, {"t": "1200", "x": 946.0, "y": 743.0}, {"t": "2400", "x": 944.0, "y": 784.0}, {"t": "9600", "x": 944.0, "y": 823.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1046.0, "y": 466.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1046.0, "y": 505.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1046.0, "y": 544.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1045.0, "y": 584.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1045.0, "y": 623.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1045.0, "y": 664.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1044.0, "y": 703.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1044.0, "y": 744.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1044.0, "y": 785.0}, {"t": "bps", "x": 1044.0, "y": 824.0}, {"t": "VHF", "x": 1125.0, "y": 468.0}, {"t": "PACSAT", "x": 1126.0, "y": 507.0}, {"t": "PSK", "x": 1127.0, "y": 546.0}, {"t": "V. 26B", "x": 1124.0, "y": 584.0}, {"t": "PACSAT", "x": 1126.0, "y": 625.0}, {"t": "PSK", "x": 1125.0, "y": 665.0}, {"t": "FSK K9NG/G3RUH", "x": 1125.0, "y": 702.0}, {"t": "MSK", "x": 1124.0, "y": 745.0}, {"t": "MSK", "x": 1123.0, "y": 786.0}, {"t": "G3RUH. U022. eq", "x": 1124.0, "y": 824.0}, {"t": "If you know", "x": 561.0, "y": 903.0}, {"t": "the VHF activity in your area uses a modem from the", "x": 803.0, "y": 902.0}, {"t": "above list other than the Bell 202 default, you may enter this", "x": 559.0, "y": 941.0}, {"t": "modem number in the command QVPACKET. The modem in QVPACKET is", "x": 557.0, "y": 981.0}, {"t": "automatically selected when . the VHF parameter is ON and the", "x": 558.0, "y": 1021.0}, {"t": "Packet mode is entered.", "x": 559.0, "y": 1062.0}, {"t": "Turn ON your VHF or UHF FM transceiver and tune to a known packet", "x": 557.0, "y": 1142.0}, {"t": "channel in your area. Most packet operation is on s implex, so", "x": 557.0, "y": 1183.0}, {"t": "the repeater offset on your transceiver should be disabled.", "x": 557.0, "y": 1223.0}, {"t": "If you know there is packet in your area, but do not know the", "x": 558.0, "y": 1263.0}, {"t": "frequency, you should try some of the following frequencies:", "x": 558.0, "y": 1303.0}, {"t": "2 meter (144 MHz) band:", "x": 556.0, "y": 1383.0}, {"t": "145.01 MHz, 145.03 MHz, 145.05 MHz,", "x": 556.0, "y": 1423.0}, {"t": "144.99 MHz, 144.97 MHz, 144.95 MHz,", "x": 556.0, "y": 1464.0}, {"t": "1—1/4 meter (220 MHz) band:", "x": 556.0, "y": 1543.0}, {"t": "223.40 MHz, 223.42 MHz, 223.44 MHz,", "x": 554.0, "y": 1584.0}, {"t": "70 cm (440 MHz) band:", "x": 554.0, "y": 1666.0}, {"t": "145.07 MHz,", "x": 1289.0, "y": 1425.0}, {"t": "144.93 MHz,", "x": 1289.0, "y": 1464.0}, {"t": "223.46 MHz,", "x": 1288.0, "y": 1586.0}, {"t": "145.09 MHz", "x": 1534.0, "y": 1424.0}, {"t": "144.91 MHz", "x": 1534.0, "y": 1464.0}, {"t": "223.48 MHz", "x": 1533.0, "y": 1585.0}, {"t": "5.", "x": 448.0, "y": 1907.0}, {"t": "7/92", "x": 240.0, "y": 2512.0}, {"t": "440.975 MHz, 441.000 MHz, 441.050 MHz, 441.025 MHz, 441.075 MHz", "x": 552.0, "y": 1705.0}, {"t": "You know you •ve found a packet channel when you hear the", "x": 552.0, "y": 1787.0}, {"t": "characteristic \"Braaaaaap\" sound of packet transmissions.", "x": 552.0, "y": 1826.0}, {"t": "Once you 've found an active packet channel, you must make sure", "x": 549.0, "y": 1908.0}, {"t": "you have enough receive audio (volume) from your transceiver to", "x": 550.0, "y": 1948.0}, {"t": "light the DCD LED on the DSP—2232 when a packet is beinq", "x": 552.0, "y": 1988.0}, {"t": "rece i ved .", "x": 551.0, "y": 2029.0}, {"t": "If the DCD LED does not light when packets are", "x": 780.0, "y": 2030.0}, {"t": "received, you must increase the audio level from your", "x": 550.0, "y": 2069.0}, {"t": "transceiver. The DCD LED must light for the DSP—2232 to be able", "x": 549.0, "y": 2108.0}, {"t": "to receive packets.", "x": 549.0, "y": 2149.0}, {"t": "You must also make sure that the DCD LED goes out when no packet", "x": 548.0, "y": 2229.0}, {"t": "signals are present on the channel.", "x": 550.0, "y": 2271.0}, {"t": "If the DCD LEP does not go", "x": 1311.0, "y": 2272.0}, {"t": "out when the channel is clear, make sure the Squelch control on", "x": 548.0, "y": 2311.0}, {"t": "If", "x": 1805.0, "y": 2352.0}, {"t": "your transceiver is set high enough to silence the speaker.", "x": 548.0, "y": 2353.0}, {"t": "the DCD LED stays on when the packet channel is quiet, your", "x": 548.0, "y": 2394.0}, {"t": "DSP—2232 will never send packets to other stations.", "x": 547.0, "y": 2434.0}, {"t": "4—5", "x": 1084.0, "y": 2517.0}]}